  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "Basel Framework: CRE22.66 SA-CCR ranges",
      "summary": "CRE22.66 assigns CRE52.20, the PFE formula, to the RC range and leaves CRE52.74 outside both ranges.",
      "impact": "Position: Netting set under two margin agreements, RC 10, aggregate add-on 40, multiplier 0.8 Reading a: Literal ranges: PFE ends at CRE52.73 so sub-netting (CRE52.74) not required; one netting set EAD=1.4*(10+32)=58.8 Reading b: With CRE52.74 split into two sub-netting sets: EAD differs per sub-set sum Difference: depends on split, e.g. several units",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
